      "parameters": {
        "content": "# item lists and html extract and http request\n\n## Purpose and structure\nThis folder contains the **item lists and html extract and http request** workflow. Its executable nodes use `dateTime`, `function`, `functionItem`, `htmlExtract`, `httpRequest`, `itemLists`, `manualTrigger`, `respondToWebhook`, `set`, `webhook`. The table and connection map below are derived from the JSON, not an inferred guarantee of behavior.\n\n## Setup\nImport inactive. Configure your own credentials and replace REPLACE_WITH_* values. Review external destinations and Code nodes before running.\n\n## Entry points\nOn clicking 'execute', Webhook\n\n## Verification\nSanitized source candidate; not runtime-tested. This overview is generated from node metadata. Read the folder README for the connection map, credential types, and license.\n\n## Attribution\nhttps://github.com/Zie619/n8n-workflows/blob/94007c1445d9258a7da116646b79473e7c7c3282/workflows/Datetime/0159_Datetime_Functionitem_Create_Webhook.json\nMIT; preserve source notices.",
        "width": 700,
        "height": 800,
        "color": 1
      }
    }
